e": "Akshay", "text": "I dont think they cared abt taj mahal per se more to prevent it from being used as a landmark to hit nearby airbases", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:22:26Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Kheria airbase in Agra was critical for recon, resupply, early warning", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:22:42Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "This is def possible", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:24:20Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "interesting… my grandfather-in-law joined the RIAF around that time, apparently it was really small in the early 1940s, with very few planes until later in the war when they started airlifting supplies to the Kuomintang in China", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:25:10Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "India was a major stopover pt for aircraft going from ME to pacific theatres", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:25:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "btw the shipment of supplies to China during that war resulted in a unique feature being built in Kharagpur, India. what?", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-28T20:25:40Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Longest platform", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]